   d. Forking or rebranding the codebase DOES NOT exempt, waive, or diminish any commercial royalty
      obligations specified in Section 3 below.

3. ENTERPRISE & COMMERCIAL REVENUE ROYALTY OBLIGATION:
   a. FLAT PER-UNIT HARDWARE ROYALTY:
      Any commercial enterprise, manufacturer, corporation, or high-revenue business that
      produces, manufactures, flashes, bundles, or sells physical hardware devices utilizing
      this software (or any fork/derivative thereof) IS REQUIRED to pay a flat intellectual
      property royalty fee of IDR 5,000 (approx. USD $0.35) per hardware unit produced or
      distributed (or as mutually negotiated in a written agreement).
   b. PAYMENT & REPORTING SCHEDULE (QUARTERLY):
      Royalty statements and payments must be settled quarterly (every 3 months, covering
      calendar quarters ending March, June, September, and December), paid within thirty (30)
      calendar days following the close of each quarter.
   c. PROJECT / SINGLE-SITE INDUSTRIAL INSTALLATIONS:
      For commercial non-mass-produced installations (e.g. industrial plant integration, single-site
      commercial facilities, municipal/estate utility automation), licensing is structured as a
      flat site license fee negotiated in writing prior to deployment.
   d. UNLIMITED COMMERCIAL BUYOUT OPTION:
      Enterprises wishing to exempt specific production models from quarterly per-unit reporting
      may request a one-time written Enterprise Commercial Buyout License directly from the Author.

